<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#05081c">
    
    <!-- DYNAMIC SEO GOLD STANDARD -->
    <title><%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Tentang Kami | Dents Web' %></title>
    <meta name="description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : 'Tech partner strategis yang bikin website lu punya performa ngebut, desain premium, dan konversi nyata tanpa gimmick.' %>">
    <meta name="keywords" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.keywords : 'tentang dents web, profil agensi digital, web developer profesional, partner teknologi' %>">
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/about' %>">
    
    <!-- Google Site Verification -->
    <% if (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.googleVerification) { %>
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content="<%= settings.googleVerification %>" />
    <% } %>
    
    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:url" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/about' %>">
    <meta property="og:title" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Tentang Kami | Dents Web' %>">
    <meta property="og:description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : '' %>">
    <meta property="og:image" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.image : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    
    <!-- Twitter Cards -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:url" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.url : 'https://dentsweb.my.id/about' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.title : 'Tentang Kami | Dents Web' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.desc : '' %>">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="<%= typeof seo !== 'undefined' ? seo.image : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">

    <!-- Schema.org JSON-LD -->
    <% if (typeof seo !== 'undefined' && seo.schemaString) { %>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
        <%- seo.schemaString %>
    </script>
    <% } %>
    
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="<%= typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.favicon ? settings.favicon : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="<%= typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.logo ? settings.logo : '/public/img/axalogo.png' %>">
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend+Deca:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <!-- About Hero -->
        <section class="section-hero" style="min-height: 50vh; padding-top: 150px; padding-bottom: 70px;">
            <div class="orb-glow-blue" style="top: -10%; left: -5%;"></div>
            <div class="orb-glow-lime" style="bottom: -15%; right: 5%; opacity: 0.1;"></div>

            <div class="container text-center" style="position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 820px;">
                <div class="badge-tag-lime" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
                    KENAL LEBIH DEKAT DENGAN DENTS WEB
                </div>
                <h1 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Bukan Cuma Bikin Web, <br><span class="font-editorial text-lime">Kami Scale Brand Lu</span>
                </h1>
                <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.76); line-height: 1.75;">
                    Kami adalah tech partner strategis yang memastikan tiap rupiah investasi digital lu ngasilin dampak nyata. Kami tolak template lelet dan arsitektur kuno.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Philosophy & Approach -->
        <section class="section-white" style="padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 90px;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 60px;">
                    <div class="tactile-card tactile-card-heavy" style="background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(33, 82, 207, 0.1); color: var(--royal-blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 12px;">Filosofi Desain &amp; Kode Kami</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--slate-body); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0;">
                            Banyak brand bakar duit buat website yang susah ditemuin di Google dan lelet dibuka pelanggan. Di Dents Web, kami bangun sebaliknya: ultra-ringan, estetika berkelas, dan SEO-ready sejak baris kode pertama dieksekusi.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="tactile-card tactile-card-heavy" style="background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(217, 255, 66, 0.25); color: #166534; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 12px;">Arsitektur Modern &amp; Serverless</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--slate-body); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0;">
                            Kombinasi Server-Side Rendering (SSR) Node.js, Cloudflare edge routing, dan optimasi Core Web Vitals bikin website lu responsif seketika tanpa jeda, siap menampung lonjakan traffic tanpa down.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 4 Core Pillars -->
                <div class="section-header text-center" style="margin-top: 80px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                    <div class="badge-tag-royal" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">CORE VALUES KAMI</div>
                    <h2>4 Pilar Komitmen Tanpa Kompromi</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="grid-4">
                    <div class="tactile-card" style="padding: 26px; background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: #e0f2fe; color: var(--royal-blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Speed Tanpa Lag</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--slate-body); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Muat secepat kilat untuk memangkas bounce rate dan bikin calon klien betah.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="tactile-card" style="padding: 26px; background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Fokus Konversi</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--slate-body); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Struktur visual dan CTA diarahkan buat mempercepat proses closing penjualan.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="tactile-card" style="padding: 26px; background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Responsif Presisi</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--slate-body); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Tampilan mulus sempurna di smartphone, tablet, laptop, hingga monitor 4K.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="tactile-card" style="padding: 26px; background: #ffffff;">
                        <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: #ede9fe; color: #6d28d9; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 8px;">Hak Milik 100%</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--slate-body); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Aset, source code, dan domain mutlak milik lu tanpa keterikatan platform tertutup.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Callout Banner -->
                <div class="tactile-card tactile-card-heavy" style="margin-top: 80px; padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center; background: #ffffff; border-color: var(--border-light); border-bottom-color: var(--royal-blue);">
                    <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--navy-text); margin-bottom: 16px;">
                        Siap Bangun Identitas Digital <span class="font-editorial text-royal">Masa Depan?</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px; color: var(--slate-body); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                        Jangan biarkan bisnis lu jalan di tempat. Konsultasikan visi dan roadmap digital lu bareng tim arsitek kami sekarang.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-royal" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                        Mulai Konsultasi Sekarang
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
